## Policy

- Source attribution and provenance are always preserved: source name,
  origin/URL when known, available retrieval dates, whole-file SHA-256
  hashes and acquisition method are recorded in `data/manifests/source_manifest.csv`
  and, for MoonProt, in `data/raw/moonprot/artifact_index.csv`.
- The five sources (MoonDB, MoonProt, MultifacetedProtDB, MultitaskProtDB-II,
  PlantMP) have license terms recorded as `terms_not_recorded`. Until per-source
  terms are verified and recorded, no redistribution of their data is
  authorized by this repository.
- Data received directly from a source maintainer, if it ever occurs, must be
  recorded as such with date and channel; no such receipt is currently
  recorded.
